in his gaze palsies and axial rigidity. Symptomatic treatment of the
hyperekplexia with benzodiazepines, gabapentin and leviteracetam has
been successful.
Conclusion: We report this unusual case (including videotaped ex-
aminations demonstrating his neurological signs) of hyperekplexia,
pontine signs and progressive rigidity with an unclassi ﬁed autoimmune
aetiology.
